  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(154)/(0.154)= (15.4)/(x)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(154)/(0.154)= (15.4)/(x)\n\nBy cross multiplication, we get\n\n154 × x = 15.4 × 0.154 \n\n⇒ x = 15.4 × 0.154/154 \n\n⇒ x = 0.0154\n\n**∴ The required result is 0.0154.**",
